  "description": "Tiny, fast, dependency-free PDF writer for .NET 10/11 and .NET MAUI 10/11 (Android/iOS). Subset-embedded TrueType fonts with full Unicode and kerning, Arabic shaping and the Unicode bidi algorithm for right-to-left text, kashida justification, separate Latin/Arabic fonts in one line, word wrap and flowing paragraphs, tables with page breaks, vector shapes, opacity and clipping, PNG and JPEG images (EXIF orientation), links and bookmarks. No reflection: trim- and AOT-safe.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "NkkinPdf",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-16T09:22:55.053Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "O841RuWFlZeKJ7TPfGeE/4uMnI74rTLi0eMTqeDOJ5JdXgpGwWLmD+K7xyLlHHmsulxX7mviDKM6svxUWK+YEw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 144264,
  "published": "2026-11-16T09:17:38.957Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.1: no longer requires preview features. 3.0.0 was built with EnablePreviewFeatures, which marked the assembly [RequiresPreviewFeatures] and forced every app using it to opt in to preview features (CA2252 errors). Removed that and the build settings that have no effect in a library. Same API as 3.0.0; builds for net10.0 and net11.0.\n3.0.0: net10.0 + net11.0 targets; stricter PNG and EXIF validation.\n2.0.x: full Unicode bidi algorithm, pair kerning, underline/strikethrough, Justify with Arabic kashida, maxLines, flowing paragraphs, dashed lines, ellipses, polygons, PdfPath, clipping, opacity, JPEG EXIF orientation, PNG pass-through, per-cell table styles, footer rows, borders, page-spanning rows, bookmarks, internal links, document language and RTL reading order, byte-identical output, smaller font subsets, 2-14x faster.",
